      "answer": "To get your father admitted to the Lari Cardiology Centre, here's the general process:\n\n1.  **OPD Registration:** Online registration is mandatory. You can register online at [www.ors.gov.in](http://www.ors.gov.in).\n2.  **Appointment:**\n    *   You can book an appointment online at [www.ors.gov.in](http://www.ors.gov.in)\n    *   Call 0522-2258880 or 0522-3539333\n    *   SMS \"APPOINTMENT <NAME>\" to 8887019134.\n3.  **Emergency Cases:** If your father's condition is critical, go directly to the Emergency Department of the Lari Cardiology Centre.\n4.  **Contact Information:** You can also try contacting the PRO Office at Lari Cardiology: 9415099528\n5.  **Bring:** Make sure to bring the printed copy of the appointment or the SMS confirmation.\n\n",
